"Conan!" you whisper urgently, "the rifle... shoot!"
Trembling with fear, Conan points his father's double-barrelled rifle at the beast. Seconds crawl slowly, agonizingly slowly...
Finally, he fires. You expect a wild roar from the furious predator, but instead, it staggers, steps backwards, and falls silently to the ground. Only a few minutes later, you pull yourself together and dare to approach the beast. It turns out that by some miracle, Conan hit it in the eye, and its death was instantaneous. Unbelievable luck!